 is &quot;The Meat Engine&quot;?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forever at war with itself, intertwined in an eternal intergalactic conflict. The Meat Engine is a planet sized sentient biomass, that scours the universe in an endless search for living matter. The rage and loathing of those lost the Meat Engine manifest in the Defective Ones. Mutated solders who would go against the rule of the Monarchs, some retain the memories of their past, other are reduced to nothing more than animals. However there is a constant between all those effected by mutation, their savage hatred towards the Meat Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/7fcb144ae988a11db02e2a0e87880661.poster.avif?t=1765249941\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/7fcb144ae988a11db02e2a0e87880661.webm?t=1765249941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/7fcb144ae988a11db02e2a0e87880661.mp4?t=1765249941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a large arsenal of <strong>biological and living weaponry</strong> to brutally eviscerate your foes, as you uncover the secrets of the <strong>Meat Engine</strong> and its mysterious origin. 8 unique weapons  are currently planned.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/b4833aa1594c8b3c8ebad2dfc9324b27.poster.avif?t=1765249941\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta